+## Discount codes
+
+An order takes one discount code at most, given with `orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`. A second code replaces the
+first. Codes are matched without regard to case or surrounding spaces.
+
+- `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the order's items, rounded to the nearest cent (a half cent rounds up).
+- `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off the order's items, only on an order whose items come to 30.00 € or more.
+
+An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused with an error that says why, and the order is left as it
+was. The discount never touches shipping: whether an order ships free is decided on its items before any discount. An
+order's totals give `discountCents` (0 without a code), and `totalCents` is items minus discount plus shipping.
